<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Smiling">>
Amarjeet: When we connect to something greater than our small worries, the mind naturally finds steadiness.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Neutral">>
Amarjeet: Tomorrow, we will learn something more.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Neutral">>
Amarjeet: Service to others creates the selflessness needed for perfect focus.

<<HideCharacter>>
As Raju leaves the temple, he carries a sense of inner quiet he's never experienced. The meditation has revealed glimpses of deeper peace beneath daily worries.

