<<set $Amarjeet_Path = "c">>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Quizzical">>
Raju: Help me understand the science behind focus, Baba.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Quizzical">>
Raju: I want to know why these techniques work.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Neutral">>
Amarjeet: Excellent question, beta. You choose the path of understanding.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Smiling">>
Amarjeet: Let me explain how the mind creates both focus and distraction.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Neutral">>
Amarjeet: The mind has two modes. Focused attention and scattered thinking.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Neutral">>
Amarjeet: Like a muscle, whichever mode you exercise more becomes stronger.

Amarjeet draws diagrams in the dust. Brain pathways. Attention networks. Raju listens intently.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: So when I practice focusing on one thing, I'm literally strengthening that mental ability?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Like physical training but for the brain?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Smiling">>
Amarjeet: Precisely!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Smiling">>
Amarjeet: And when you understand the mechanism, you can design better training for your specific needs.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Neutral">>
Amarjeet: Tomorrow, we will study how emotions affect concentration.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Neutral">>
Amarjeet: And learn to work with your mind's natural patterns.

<<HideCharacter>>
As Raju leaves after choosing the path of understanding, his mind buzzes with intellectual clarity. Knowledge of mental mechanisms can transform practice from mysterious ritual into precise psychological engineering.

