<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Neutral">>
Amarjeet: Today you will serve others, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Amarjeet" "Neutral">>
Amarjeet: When the mind focuses on giving rather than getting, it naturally becomes still.

Hours pass. Raju serves meals, cleans dishes, helps elderly visitors. His usual self-concerns fade away.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
